<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Login - VASUP-Testdata' }) %></head>
<body>
<div class="auth-shell">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <h1>VASUP-Testdata</h1>
    <div class="sub">AI test data agent for VASUP Senior Testers</div>

    <% if (error) { %><div class="error-box"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <% if (notice) { %><div class="notice-box"><%= notice %></div><% } %>

    <form method="post" action="/login">
      <div class="field">
        <label>VASUP email (or admin username)</label>
        <input type="text" name="identifier" placeholder="name@vasup.co.th" required autofocus />
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Password</label>
        <input type="password" name="password" required />
      </div>
      <button class="btn" type="submit" style="width:100%;">Sign in</button>
    </form>

    <div class="auth-links">
      New tester? <a href="/register">Request access</a> &middot;
      <a href="/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a>
    </div>

    <div class="notes-block">
      <b>Notes</b>
      In future release we will have AI check the project name and all the doc with actual reference
      from another web portal. But for now we will use this — that is, AI will check all the reference
      amount other VASUP AI TOOLS.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
